ST[26]="A stranger in the queue whispers: hide me.~Shelter them~You risk everything. Three nights later a note under your door says: thank you.~Walk on~The queue moves. You will remember their face for years.";
ST[27]="A door stands in the middle of the road with nothing behind it.~Open it~It opens onto the same road. The road is nicer.~Walk around~From behind, the door is a wall of static.";
ST[28]="The waiter drops his tray again.~Catch it~For the first time in a thousand loops it does not shatter. He weeps.~Let it fall~It shatters. It always shatters. Maybe that is how it stays.";
