E.push(["Error Earth","Earth was never here",225,5,"o",['#000',1,'#000',1,0,0,0,'#fff',0,9],[0,0,"The Empty Focus"],"Voss|ERROR: EARTH NOT FOUND. There is no Earth here, and there never was. It is not destroyed and it is not hidden. It is missing, like a word left out of a sentence. The Moon still circles the place where a world should be, pulled by a gravity with no source, keeping perfect time for something that never happened. Tides on the Moon tick against nothing. We recorded a night sky without a single human light. Idris asked whether we were the first thing ever to look at this empty space. Then the gate displayed a return address, and it was ours."]);
