[[[["Lantern Earth","Electricity was never found",40,1,"o",['#14305a',.5,'#b88a3a',.55,0,0,.4,'#ffe9b0',1.5,0],[35,135,"The Night Market"],"Idris|Nobody here ever found electricity, so they never stopped looking up. Every street is a river of paper lanterns, and the night markets run until dawn on candle wax and trust. Voss bought a lantern that has not gone out in nine days. We think it is only very patient. Nothing here has ever tried to harm us."],"Lantern","Electric spark never found|~3 billion|Lantern wardens|Candle engines, paper kites",["#1a1030","#ffcf70","#0a0618","c","*l"],"chime","A lantern-seller asks if you are lost, or only looking.~Say lost~She lights one for you and tells you to follow it home.~Say looking~She laughs and sells you a very small, very bright lantern.","🏮"],
[["Orchard Earth","One planet-wide garden",110,2,"o",['#1a4a3a',.4,'#5aa83a',.8,0,0,.5,'#f4ffe0',.6,0],[-12,28,"The Central Hive"],"Mara|Agriculture won. Borders were abandoned for orchards, and the bees run what passes for a government. The hive council voted on our visit for eleven days and then sent a delegation with honey. The Echo gate code is on a jar label in the central hive: 5528. Do not argue with a beekeeper about the law."],"Orchard","Farming never industrialised|~2 billion|The Hive Council|Living hedges, honey batteries",["#2a5a2a","#fff2a0","#143014","f","o"],"jungle","A beekeeper in a veil offers you a jar, and a seat at the council.~Take the seat~You are voted in on the third round, unanimously, and then voted out gently.~Take the jar~The jar is warm. So is the way they watch you carry it.","🐝"],
[["Clockwork Earth","Everything runs on gears",30,6,"o",['#3a2a14',.6,'#9a7a3a',.7,0,0,.4,'#e0d0b0',.5,2],[48,11,"The Great Escapement"],"Voss|Steam was never the end of it. Cities here are clocks with streets for gears, and every window shows the same hour. The Tick Wardens fine you for being late to the wrong moment. Idris lost an afternoon to a staircase that is also a spring. If the bell rings twice, step out of the street. Do not ask what the third bell is for."],"Cogwork","Mechanical computation wins|~1.2 billion|Tick Wardens|Gear logic, spring cities",["#2a1c0a","#ffc060","#1a1006","c","*l"],"clock","A warden checks a pocket watch and then checks you.~Apologise~He nods once and moves your appointment back by exactly one tick.~Argue the hour~The street tightens around you like a wound spring.","⏲️"],
[["Hollow Earth","We live inside the planet",280,9,"s",['#0a0a20',.8,'#2a1a3a',.7,0,0,.3,'#6a5a8a',.8,2],[0,-90,"The Inner Sun"],"Voss|SIGNAL FAILING. The sky is rock and the sun is a small, hot argument at the centre. The horizon curves up. We walked until the far side of the world was overhead and waving. Do not look at the inner sun for long. It looks back. Idris says the people here are kind. I say so are the cliffs."],"Core","Crust never sealed · life turned inward|~800 million|The Inward Council|Geothermal engines, rock-cities",["#08051a","#c070ff","#04020c","m","*o"],"void","The inner sun dims, and a crowd on the ceiling turns to look at you.~Wave back~Ten thousand of them wave, in unison, upside down.~Stay still~The sun brightens until you are only a shadow on the floor.","🕳️"],
[["Echo Earth","Every sound repeats forever",205,7,"l",['#10264a',.6,'#3a4a6a',.6,0,.2,.8,'#dfe8ff',.2,0],[64,-20,"The Long Valley"],"Mara|A shout here becomes a chorus that never stops. The valleys hold decades of arguments and lullabies, layered like sediment. People whisper by law and write by habit. We heard our own arrival three days after it happened. Idris sang once, by mistake. I think the planet still has it.","5528"],"Echo","Resonant planet · sound never decays|~500 million|The Whisper Court|Silence-silk, echo libraries",["#0a1430","#8ab0ff","#060c1c","m","*"],"waves","A scribe puts a finger to her lips, and then to your throat.~Whisper~Your words settle into the valley like snow. Years from now, someone will find them.~Speak normally~Your voice comes back at you for nine minutes, then keeps going.","🔔"]]].forEach(L=>L.forEach(([e,g,f,sc,am,st,em])=>{const k=E.length;E.push(e);G.push(g);F.push(f);SC.push(sc);AMB.push(am);ST[k]=st;EM.push(em)}));
